1
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Meet Stuart, Kevin & Bob.

2
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Minions is a family, animation, adventure film directed by Kyle Balda.

3
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Minions Stuart, Kevin and Bob are recruited by Scarlet Overkill, a super-villain who,
alongside her inventor husband Herb, hatches a plot to take over the world.

4
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:18,000
Scarlet Overkill (voice), played by Sandra Bullock.

5
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:51,000
Herb Overkill (voice), played by Jon Hamm.

6
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:24,000
Walter Nelson (voice), played by Michael Keaton.

7
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:57,000
Madge Nelson (voice), played by Allison Janney.

8
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Professor Flux / Tower Guard (voice), played by Steve Coogan.

9
00:40:57,000 --> 00:41:03,000
Reine Elizabeth II (voice), played by Jennifer Saunders.

10
00:45:30,000 --> 00:45:36,000
Minions is a 2015 American animated comedy film directed by Pierre
Coffin and Kyle Balda and written by Brian Lynch.

11
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:09,000
Produced by Illumination Entertainment, it is a prequel to Despicable Me
(2010) and the third installment in the Despicable Me franchise.

12
00:54:36,000 --> 00:54:42,000
The film features the voices of Coffin (as the Minions), Sandra Bullock, Jon Hamm, Michael Keaton,
Allison Janney, Steve Coogan and Jennifer Saunders, with Geoffrey Rush as the narrator.

13
00:59:09,000 --> 00:59:15,000
In the film, the Minions search for their replaceable evil boss after, one-by-one,
accidentally killing all their past leaders throughout history.

14
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:48,000
Minions premiered in London on June 11, 2015, and was released in
the United States on July 10, by Universal Pictures.

15
01:08:15,000 --> 01:08:21,000
It received mixed reviews from critics.

16
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
The film grossed $1.16 billion, becoming the fifth-highest-grossing film of 2015, the
second-highest-grossing animated film and the tenth-highest-grossing film of all time.

17
01:17:21,000 --> 01:17:27,000
A sequel, Minions: The Rise of Gru, was released in 2022,
while a third film is due to be released in 2026.

18
01:21:54,000 --> 01:22:00,000
The film explores themes of assistant, villain, prequel,
aftercreditsstinger, duringcreditsstinger.

19
01:26:27,000 --> 01:26:33,000
The tone is lighthearted.
